---
title: Threat Intelligence Integration Sequence Diagram
author: Project Sentinel
---

sequenceDiagram
    actor User as Pro User (Dashboard)
    participant Backend as Sentinel Backend API
    participant ThreatAPI as Threat Intelligence API

    User->>Backend: Inspect alert (requests threat intel)
    Backend->>ThreatAPI: Query threat intelligence (e.g., VirusTotal, OTX, AbuseIPDB)
    ThreatAPI-->>Backend: Return threat data (reputation, CVE, etc.)
    Backend->>Backend: Enrich alert with threat intelligence
    Backend-->>User: Return enriched alert details
    User->>User: View alert with threat intelligence context
